#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:86
msgid "Available `CalibrationMethod` values are differential evolution, genetic algorithm, simulated annealing, particle swarm, Bayesian optimization, gradient descent, Adam, and Limited-memory Broyden-Fletcher-Goldfarb-Shanno (L-BFGS)."
msgstr "受支持的 `CalibrationMethod` 枚举值包括差分进化、遗传算法、模拟退火、粒子群优化、贝叶斯优化、梯度下降、Adam 以及有限内存拟牛顿法（Limited-memory Broyden-Fletcher-Goldfarb-Shanno, L-BFGS）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:90
msgid "The enum is a shared method identity, not one eight-algorithm execution facade. `ParameterCalibrator` owns only the five derivative-free methods: differential evolution, genetic algorithm, simulated annealing, particle swarm, and Bayesian optimization. `GradientCalibrator` separately owns gradient descent, Adam, and L-BFGS. Passing a gradient method to `ParameterCalibrator.calibrate(...)` raises before logging, hooks, RNG, ParameterManager mutation, objective evaluation, dispatch, or progress effects."
msgstr "该 enum 是共享的方法标识，而不是一个囊括八种算法的执行 facade。`ParameterCalibrator` 仅拥有五种无导数方法：differential evolution、genetic algorithm、simulated annealing、particle swarm 和 Bayesian optimization。`GradientCalibrator` 单独拥有 gradient descent、Adam 和 L-BFGS。将梯度方法传给 `ParameterCalibrator.calibrate(...)` 会在日志、hook、RNG、ParameterManager 修改、目标函数求值、分派或进度效果发生之前抛出异常。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:98
msgid "`ParameterCalibrator` (derivative-free owner)"
msgstr "`ParameterCalibrator`（无导数方法 owner）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:116
msgid "`ObjectiveFunction.__call__(parameters, observations)` returns a scalar value to minimize. The built-in objective classes include Mean Squared Error (`MSEObjective`), Root Mean Squared Error (`RMSEObjective`), and `NashSutcliffeObjective`."
msgstr "`ObjectiveFunction.__call__(parameters, observations)` 返回待最小化的标量目标值。内置目标函数类包括均方误差（Mean Squared Error, `MSEObjective`）、均方根误差（Root Mean Squared Error, `RMSEObjective`）以及纳什-萨特克利夫效率系数目标 `NashSutcliffeObjective`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:166
msgid "The target key must be valid for the active parameter manager and the callback must return values compatible with the observation tensor. A model failure or a missing output variable in the built-in scalar objectives raises; there is no infinite penalty value. A failed calibration triggers the `CALIBRATION_ERROR` hook event and re-raises."
msgstr "目标键必须对活动参数管理器有效，回调返回值必须与观测张量兼容。模型失败或内置标量目标缺少输出变量时会报错，不返回无穷惩罚值。校准失败会触发 `CALIBRATION_ERROR` 钩子事件并重新抛出异常。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:172
msgid "`GradientCalibrator` (gradient owner)"
msgstr "`GradientCalibrator`（梯度方法 owner）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:210
msgid "`method` is required. Every numeric setting that is not stated (shown as `...`) is read from `optimization.calibration.*` in the parameter database; the Adam settings there are the Algorithm 1 values of Kingma and Ba (2015). `GradientCalibrator` requires both the caller's ParameterManager and a `config`; a missing one raises `ValueError`, so implicit process-global calibration state and a default optimizer are both rejected. The objective must return one finite differentiable scalar and every requested target must produce a finite gradient. Candidate values remain isolated from canonical manager state until one accepted point is committed as an atomic manager batch."
msgstr "`method` 必填。未设置的数值选项（显示为 `...`）从参数数据库的 `optimization.calibration.*` 读取，其中 Adam 设置采用 Kingma 和 Ba（2015）算法 1 的值。`GradientCalibrator` 同时要求调用方的 ParameterManager 和 `config`；缺少任一项均抛出 `ValueError`，因此不允许隐式进程全局校准状态或默认优化器。目标必须返回单个有限、可微的标量，每个请求的目标参数必须产生有限梯度。在将一个接受点作为原子管理器批次提交前，候选值始终与规范管理器状态隔离。"

