#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:277
msgid "Global sensitivity analysis"
msgstr "全球敏感性分析"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:279
msgid "`ParameterRange`"
msgstr "`ParameterRange`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:297
msgid "`distribution` is keyword-only and required: `uniform`, `normal`, `lognormal`, or `triangular`. Bounds must be ordered. `normal` and `lognormal` need an explicit `mean` and a finite positive `std` (for `lognormal`, `mean` is the positive median), and `triangular` needs its mode as `mean` inside the bounds; nothing is derived from the bounds. `sample(n_samples, random_state=None)` draws from a local generator, clips normal and lognormal draws to the bounds, and applies integer or log scaling when requested. Declared `units` must equal the units of the `ParameterSpec` of the parameter key of the same name; units declared for a name that is not a parameter key raise `ValueError` when an analyzer validates the ranges. Morris and Sobol analysis accept only uniform ranges without log scaling or integer values; any other declaration raises `NotImplementedError`."
msgstr "`distribution` 是必填的仅关键字参数，取 `uniform`、`normal`、`lognormal` 或 `triangular`。上下界必须有序。`normal` 和 `lognormal` 需要显式 `mean` 和有限正值 `std`（`lognormal` 的 `mean` 为正中位数）；`triangular` 需要用边界内的 `mean` 指定众数，不从边界推导这些值。`sample(n_samples, random_state=None)` 使用局部生成器抽样，将正态和对数正态样本裁剪到边界，并按请求应用整数或对数变换。声明的 `units` 必须等于同名参数键 `ParameterSpec` 的单位；分析器验证范围时，为非参数名称声明单位会抛出 `ValueError`。Morris 和 Sobol 仅接受不带对数缩放或整数值的均匀范围；其他声明抛出 `NotImplementedError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:310
msgid "Callback contract"
msgstr "回调契约"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:312
msgid "Both analyzers use:"
msgstr "两者分析器使用："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:325
msgid "The runner accepts one parameter mapping and returns scalar outputs by name. `baseline_parameters` supplies fixed parameters and is merged with each sampled mapping."
msgstr "跑者接受一个参数映射并以名称返回标量输出。`baseline_parameters`提供固定参数并与每个采样映射合并。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:329
msgid "`MorrisAnalyzer`"
msgstr "`MorrisAnalyzer`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:338
msgid "`config` is required: an analyzer built without it raises `TypeError`. `MorrisConfig` takes `aggregation_method` as a required keyword (`mean`, `sum`, `max`, `std`, or `final`); its numeric fields `n_trajectories`, `n_levels`, and `grid_jump`, when left unset, read `optimization.sensitivity.morris.*`. The constructor requires a positive trajectory count and grid jump, at least two levels, and 2 x `grid_jump` <= `n_levels`."
msgstr "`config` 必填，未提供时构造分析器会抛出 `TypeError`。`MorrisConfig` 要求关键字 `aggregation_method`（`mean`、`sum`、`max`、`std` 或 `final`）；其数值字段 `n_trajectories`、`n_levels` 和 `grid_jump` 未设置时读取 `optimization.sensitivity.morris.*`。构造器要求轨迹数和网格跳跃量为正、至少两个水平，并满足 2 x `grid_jump` <= `n_levels`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:346
msgid "Use Morris screening to rank many parameters with fewer evaluations. The result contains elementary-effect statistics, output-wise sensitivity indices, execution counts, timing, and convergence metadata."
msgstr "使用Morris筛选法按较少的评估次数排名许多参数。结果包含基本效应统计、输出级敏感性指数、执行次数、时间以及收敛metadata。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:350
msgid "`SobolAnalyzer`"
msgstr "`SobolAnalyzer`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:359
msgid "`config` is required here as well (`TypeError` without it). `SobolConfig` takes `aggregation_method` and `estimator` as required keywords; only the `saltelli` estimator is implemented (`janon`, `glen`, and `owen` raise `NotImplementedError`). Its other fields are `n_samples`, `skip_values`, `scramble`, `calc_second_order`, `convergence_check`, `convergence_samples`, and `batch_size`; `n_samples` and `skip_values`, when left unset, read `optimization.sensitivity.sobol.*`. Sample and batch counts must be positive."
msgstr "此处 `config` 也必填（缺少时抛出 `TypeError`）。`SobolConfig` 要求关键字 `aggregation_method` 和 `estimator`；仅实现 `saltelli` 估计器（`janon`、`glen` 和 `owen` 均抛出 `NotImplementedError`）。其余字段为 `n_samples`、`skip_values`、`scramble`、`calc_second_order`、`convergence_check`、`convergence_samples` 和 `batch_size`；`n_samples` 与 `skip_values` 未设置时读取 `optimization.sensitivity.sobol.*`。样本数和批次数必须为正。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:367
msgid "Use Sobol analysis for first-order and total-order variance decomposition; second-order indices are not implemented (`calc_second_order=True` raises `NotImplementedError`). An empty parameter-range mapping raises `ValueError`; analysis failures are wrapped in `RuntimeError`."
msgstr "使用 Sobol 分析计算一阶和总阶方差分解；尚未实现二阶指数（`calc_second_order=True` 抛出 `NotImplementedError`）。参数范围映射为空时抛出 `ValueError`；分析失败包装为 `RuntimeError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:402
msgid "Uncertainty quantification"
msgstr "不确定性量化"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:404
msgid "`UncertainParameter`"
msgstr "`UncertainParameter`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:424
msgid "Supported distributions are uniform, normal, lognormal, beta, gamma, and triangular. Bounds must be ordered. `NORMAL` and `LOGNORMAL` parameters must give `mean` and `std`; a `UNIFORM` parameter without them takes the moments of its bounds, and a triangular parameter needs an explicit `mode`. `alpha`, `beta`, and `mode` configure distribution-specific shape. `sample()` applies physical bounds and requested integer or log transforms."
msgstr "支持均匀、正态、对数正态、beta、gamma 和三角分布。上下界必须有序。`NORMAL` 和 `LOGNORMAL` 参数必须给出 `mean` 与 `std`；`UNIFORM` 参数缺少这两项时使用由边界确定的矩，三角分布参数需要显式 `mode`。`alpha`、`beta` 和 `mode` 配置各分布的形状。`sample()` 应用物理边界以及请求的整数或对数变换。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:431
msgid "`EnsembleUQ` and `BootstrapUQ`"
msgstr "`EnsembleUQ`和`BootstrapUQ`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:445
msgid "`config` is required: either class built without it raises `TypeError`. `EnsembleConfig` needs `sampling_strategy` (`random`, Latin Hypercube Sampling `lhs`, or `sobol`) and `BootstrapConfig` needs `bootstrap_type` (`parametric` or `residual`) and `ci_method` (`percentile` or `bca`), each as a keyword."
msgstr "`config` 为必传参数：任一类在未传入该参数时构造均会抛出 `TypeError`。`EnsembleConfig` 要求以关键字参数传入 `sampling_strategy`（可选 `random`、拉丁超立方抽样（Latin Hypercube Sampling）`lhs` 或 `sobol`）；`BootstrapConfig` 要求以关键字参数传入 `bootstrap_type`（`parametric` 或 `residual`）与 `ci_method`（`percentile` 或 `bca`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:450
msgid "Both expose:"
msgstr "均暴露："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:464
msgid "`EnsembleUQ` propagates sampled parameter distributions through the callback. Its configuration controls ensemble size, sampling, parallel evaluation, localization, adaptive sampling, chunking, and outlier handling. `BootstrapUQ` supports parametric and residual resampling; residual bootstrap uses `observations`."
msgstr "`EnsembleUQ`通过回调传播采样参数分布。其配置控制ensemble大小、采样、并行评估、局部化、自适应采样、分块和异常值处理。`BootstrapUQ`支持参数和残差重采样；残差自助法使用`observations`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:470
msgid "`UQResult` reports output means, standard deviations, variances, percentiles, confidence intervals, optional samples, skewness, kurtosis, correlations, sample and evaluation counts, timing, convergence, effective sample sizes, and Monte Carlo error."
msgstr "`UQResult`报告输出均值、标准差、方差、百分位数、置信区间、可选样本、偏度、峰度、相关性、样本和评估计数、时间、收敛性、有效样本大小以及蒙特卡罗误差。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md:475
msgid "By default, failed samples and missing outputs are not accepted. Change `allow_failed_samples` or `allow_missing_outputs` only when the resulting sentinel values are explicitly handled downstream."
msgstr "默认情况下，失败样本和缺失输出不予接受。仅当下游处理过程中明确处理结果 sentinel 值时才修改`allow_failed_samples`或`allow_missing_outputs`。"

