msgid "Use the Python APIs on this page for bounded component-level calibration, sensitivity analysis, and UQ. The public optimization CLI and HTTP routes are explicitly `[N] runtime_unbound`: they reject before executing an objective, constructing an optimizer workflow, or mutating parameters because no sealed GraphIR/ExecutionPlan/GraphExecutor and simulator lifecycle is bound. Their command and schema presence must not be treated as an end-to-end model workflow."
msgstr "请使用本页的 Python API 进行有界的组件级校准、敏感性分析与 UQ。公开的优化 CLI 与 HTTP 路由被显式标记为 `[N] runtime_unbound`：由于没有绑定已封闭的 GraphIR/ExecutionPlan/GraphExecutor 与 simulator 生命周期，它们会在执行目标函数、构造优化器工作流或修改参数之前拒绝。它们的命令与 schema 的存在不得被视为端到端的模型工作流。"

